{
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 456
        },
        "text": "Quad UV, time and the particle colour / alpha."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_swirl",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2292
        },
        "text": "`uvTwirl` rotates each UV around the centre by an angle that depends on its radius — the straight noise grid becomes spiral arms. Layer A turns with `time × spin`, layer B the other way at 0.6× and a different scale, so the arms slowly slide through each other."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_shape",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 893
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`r` = distance from the centre (1 at the quad edge). The noise pushes the edge radius: `r' = r + (noise − ½) × wobble`. Disc alpha = `1 − smoothstep(R − soft, R, r')`. The rim is the band `[R − width, R]` of `r'` (smoothstep up, then clipped by the disc); the core is `(1 − r / size)²`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_color",
        "position": {
          "x": 3178,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2684
        },
        "text": "The noise (darkened towards the outside, brightened by the core) indexes the shared **Color Ramp** kit. Rim and core are added in HDR on top: `colour = ramp + rim × rimColor × intensity + core × coreColor`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_alpha",
        "position": {
          "x": 3178,
          "y": 1245
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "`alpha = disc × particle alpha`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 6066,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Alpha blend, ZWrite off, two-sided."
      }
    ],
